This LMS project uses Cursor rules in `.cursor/rules/`. Always follow them.

- `project-core.mdc` — always applies: stack, folder layout, routing, imports
- `language.mdc` — i18n / translation workflow
- `features.mdc` — feature module structure (auth vs operator/learner)
- `forms.mdc` — UiForm, Zod schemas, field components
- `design.mdc` — Tailwind design system and UI primitives
- `testing.mdc` — Vitest and Testing Library conventions

Do not introduce patterns, libraries, or file locations outside these rules.
